Palette and chip anatomy (edge spots, rim, inlay) follow:
  Source: https://opengameart.org/content/poker-chips-0
  Author: looneybits
  License: CC0-1.0 (public domain dedication)

The per-denomination vectors in this directory (chip-1.svg, chip-5.svg,
chip-25.svg, chip-100.svg, chip-500.svg, chip-1000.svg, chip-5000.svg) and the
chips.svg contact sheet are original redraws for this project, dedicated to the
public domain under CC0-1.0. Each disc is drawn as a single stackable cylinder
so the table can render a pot as the chips that actually make it up.
